  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_cammou",
      "name": {
        "en": "Click's Badge",
        "zh": "卡达证章",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_cammou",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Click has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for manipulating hovering units to combat and pursue the enemy in concert.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Caster Operator during field operations to exercise Mech-accord Caster responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员卡达擅长操纵浮游单元协同作战，追击敌人\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为术师干员，行使驭械术师职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_cammou",
      "name": {
        "en": "Big Feline Desensitization Experiment",
        "zh": "大菲林脱敏实验",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "Y",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_cammou",
      "description": {
        "en": "<Video script: Click's Big Feline Desensitization Experiment>\n1. Daytime - Rhodes Island deck - Panoramic - Click does greeting and cheerfully introduces the video\n'Cool, I think this take's good!\n'You alright, Click? You look kinda nervous. Relax, you're a professional, and fanservice comedy uploads like this are easy money. Just follow the script and it'll go great. Let's have fun with this collab!\n'...You know you're smiling kind of awkward?'\n2. Daytime - Training Room - Close-up - Indra's just come out of training, Click bravely challenges her to a boxing match\n'Nice, good stuff. Uhh, why did you run away after you challenged her, though?\n'Let's try one more, and don't shake your legs this time, Click... no noises either!'\n3. Daytime - Training Room - Close-up - Click and Broca train together, then arm-wrestle\n'Three, two, one—go! You got this, Click! Do it! You don't have to win, what matters is how brave you were!\n'...Oh, shit, stopstopstop! Broca, when you win, don't lift her like a trophy! Oh my god, she's gone rigid!'\n4. Daytime - Library - Close-up - Click and Mountain read during a comfy afternoon\n'Okay, she's finally calming down, thank god we did this in a library...\n'Click, stay exactly like that, just do a little presentation to the camera? Comfy afternoon, tell us what you're reading?\n'...100 Ways to Die Suddenly?! ...Cut!!'\n5. Evening - Reception Room - Close-up - Click sits down with a phenomenal Kjerag entrepreneur to talk over a game of chess\n'Mr. SilverAsh, huge apologies for the delays to your shoot, we had some accidents... but we <i>are</i> rolling now, um, is there any reason you're standing out here? Then who's inside playing against Click?\n'...Tenzin?!'\n6. Evening - Rhodes Island corridor - Close-up - Click ■■■■■■ (paper torn here)\n'Cut, cut! Blaze, <i>what</i> is your deal? That's not how the script goes! ...I'm sorry, Click <i>just</i> discussed this with you? And I'm supposed to just stand there and shoot? Excuse me?\n'Click, I don't know if this means anything, but your eyes are red...\n'Do we <i>need</i> the window open, Blaze? What's the point of you carrying Click? Wait, did you just jump—\n'BLAGH! THAT—OH, THAT KILLS PEOPLE!! CLICK!!! I AM NEVER COLLABING WITH YOU EVER AGAIN!!!'",
        "zh": "《拍摄脚本：卡达的大菲林脱敏实验》\n1.白天；罗德岛甲板；全景；卡达打招呼并兴致勃勃地介绍本次拍摄\n“好，这条没什么问题！\n“卡达你怎么看起来有些紧张？放心，你是专业的，这种粉丝向搞笑视频也很简单，跟着脚本做效果就好。希望我们合作愉快！\n“……你为什么笑得这么尴尬？”\n2.白天；训练室；近景；卡达对刚结束训练的因陀罗勇敢地发起拳击挑战\n“对，很好。呃，挑战是发起了，但你怎么逃跑了？\n“我们再来一条，卡达你的腿不要抖啊……声音也不要！”\n3.白天；训练室；近景；卡达和布洛卡一同训练，并比赛掰手腕\n“三、二、一——开始！卡达加油！加油！输了没有关系，重要的是你挑战的勇气！\n“……天啊等等！布洛卡先生，请不要把卡达当作获胜奖杯举起来！她已经僵硬了！”\n4.白天；图书室；近景；卡达和山惬意的下午茶阅读时光\n“太好了，还好是在图书室看书，她终于平静下来了……\n“卡达，保持你现在的状态，对着镜头介绍一下，在这段惬意的下午茶时光里你看的是什么书呢？\n“……《人被突然杀死的一百种方法》？！……咔！！”\n5.傍晚；会客室；近景；卡达与谢拉格优秀企业家共坐商谈，对棋一局\n“银灰先生，很抱歉因为一些意外推迟了和您的拍摄……但拍摄已经开始了，您怎么在外面站着？那在里面和卡达下棋的是谁？\n“……丹增？！”\n6.傍晚；罗德岛走廊；近景；卡达■■■（纸张此处已经被扯掉）\n“咔、咔！煌小姐，你要干什么，这个不是台本上写的东西！……你说这是卡达刚和你商量的，我站在这里拍摄就好？什么意思？\n“卡达你的眼睛怎么变红了……\n“煌小姐你怎么开窗了？你抱着卡达做什么？你怎么跳下——\n“啊！出人命了！！卡达！！！下次我再也不会和你合作了！！！”",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
